.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
.Dd October 29, 2026
.Dt NOQTIS-PROVE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm noqtis-prove
.Nd prove that some files are in a capsule, without the others
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm noqtis prove
.Op Fl p Ar key.pub
.Op Fl o Ar file
.Op Fl f
.Ar dir
.Ar path ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm noqtis prove
writes a proof that the files
.Ar path ...
are in the format 2 capsule
.Ar dir
.Pq Xr noqtis-capsule 5 :
the seal, the manifest's head (its Merkle root and number of files) and,
for each file, its entry and its Merkle audit path.
A reader checks the proof with
.Xr noqtis-check 1
.Fl -proof ,
which verifies the seal's signature over the head and each path to the
signed root, and, given the files, the files against their entries.
The proof holds no name, size or digest of the capsule's other files.
.Pp
Paths are relative to
.Ar dir ,
with
.Ql /
between folders, as the manifest lists them; one given twice is proven
once.
The capsule must check first, against
.Fl p
when given: a proof of a capsule that does not check is not written.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl p Ar key.pub , Fl -pub Ns = Ns Ar key.pub
The public key the capsule must be sealed with.
.It Fl o Ar file , Fl -out Ns = Ns Ar file
Write the proof to
.Ar file
instead of standard output.
.It Fl f , Fl -force
Replace
.Ar file
if it exists.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width 3n -compact
.It 0
The proof was written.
.It 1
The capsule does not check.
.It 2
A usage error, a format 1 capsule, a path the manifest does not list, a
file that cannot be written, or a library error.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
Seal in format 2, prove one file, and check the proof without the rest
of the folder:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ noqtis seal --format 2 -k me results
$ noqtis prove -p me.pub -o in.proof results data/in.csv
$ noqtis check -p me.pub --proof in.proof
.Ed
.Pp
With the file at hand, check it too:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ noqtis check -p me.pub --proof in.proof results
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr noqtis 1 ,
.Xr noqtis-check 1 ,
.Xr noqtis-seal 1 ,
.Xr nqchkp 3 ,
.Xr nqprove 3 ,
.Xr noqtis-capsule 5
.Sh STANDARDS
.Rs
.%R RFC 9162
.%T Certificate Transparency Version 2.0
.%D December 2021
.Re
